WEBVTT

00:00:00.105 --> 00:00:05.759
Add subjects

00:00:05.809 --> 00:00:08.998
Open Academics, then Subjects.

00:00:11.693 --> 00:00:15.212
In the Subjects tab, press Add Subject.

00:00:16.587 --> 00:00:22.270
Enter the subject name. The code is filled in for you, and you can edit it.

00:00:28.884 --> 00:00:33.008
Press Create. The subject appears in the list.

00:00:35.378 --> 00:00:40.007
To use the subject in a class, open the class assignments tab.

00:00:41.938 --> 00:00:46.620
The subject is added
